<title>JAPAN: Miyota - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Miyota - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 18.11		vs	   18.94</p>
<p> Operating	  661    million	  vs	  627    million</p>
<p> Current	    654    million	  vs	  646    million</p>
<p> Net		  332    million	  vs	  342    million</p>
<p> EPS		   32.54 yen	  vs	   34.37 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     10 million	  vs	  10 million</p>
<p> Interim div	  6.00 yen	  vs	    5.50 yen</p>
<p>NOTE - Miyota Co Ltd is a maker of wrist watches, quartz resonators and electronic image equipment.</p>
</text>
